WEBVTT

00:00:09.280 --> 00:00:10.190
Shino!

00:00:10.900 --> 00:00:14.200
Why don’t you enjoy the hot 
springs while we’re here?

00:00:14.860 --> 00:00:17.950
I imagine we will be leaving 
within the next few days.

00:00:18.910 --> 00:00:19.700
Why’s that?

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:21.370
Why not?

00:00:21.370 --> 00:00:24.710
In the end, Akihiko wasn’t 
the eighth one, remember?

00:00:25.870 --> 00:00:28.960
We have nothing to gain 
by lingering around here.

00:00:29.420 --> 00:00:30.610
Yeah, but...

00:00:31.200 --> 00:00:32.970
Are you worried about Shinobu?

00:00:34.330 --> 00:00:34.970
Yeah.

00:00:36.180 --> 00:00:41.310
Ever since Shinobu went to sleep 
that day, he hasn’t woken back up.

00:00:50.810 --> 00:00:53.030
That hurts, Mom!

00:00:53.870 --> 00:00:54.610
Mom...?

00:00:55.070 --> 00:00:56.610
Hey, where are going?

00:00:58.410 --> 00:01:01.870
Mom? Hey, Mom?

00:01:03.080 --> 00:01:04.830
Mom! Mom...! Mom...!

00:02:53.920 --> 00:02:58.390
Encompassing Heavens

00:02:55.020 --> 00:02:57.650
Master Satomi may be his guardian,

00:02:57.650 --> 00:03:00.030
but I swear that brat brings 
nothing but trouble with him!

00:03:00.320 --> 00:03:02.360
I can’t believe you’re 
still going on about that!

00:03:02.360 --> 00:03:03.820
Grandma...?

00:03:03.820 --> 00:03:06.880
Goodness, me! Look who just woke up.

00:03:06.880 --> 00:03:10.920
He was bound to get sick of 
sleeping after a full week of it!

00:03:11.280 --> 00:03:12.790
I’m hungry...

00:03:12.790 --> 00:03:14.040
Yes, I hear you!

00:03:14.500 --> 00:03:17.340
And to think you had me worried sick!

00:03:17.340 --> 00:03:19.380
Just give me a quick minute.

00:03:24.410 --> 00:03:25.920
What happened to Akihiko?

00:03:25.920 --> 00:03:28.930
We held the funeral while 
you were busy sleeping.

00:03:30.310 --> 00:03:33.370
Akihiko was normal until the 
day before that happened...

00:03:33.940 --> 00:03:36.940
Nothing about him stood 
out as different.

00:03:37.250 --> 00:03:40.030
Children have a hard time 
differentiating between

00:03:40.030 --> 00:03:41.660
“this side” and 
the “other side.”

00:03:41.660 --> 00:03:43.530
By the time he came back,

00:03:43.530 --> 00:03:46.410
that child probably already 
belonged to the other side.

00:03:47.700 --> 00:03:50.200
Shinobu, you need to be careful.

00:03:51.620 --> 00:03:54.020
For you to have fallen 
into such a long slumber,

00:03:54.020 --> 00:03:57.020
it may have affected you 
in some way as well.

00:03:57.920 --> 00:03:58.830
Uh-huh...

00:04:06.890 --> 00:04:07.740
Shino!

00:04:07.740 --> 00:04:10.680
Shinobu! Up at last?

00:04:10.680 --> 00:04:11.850
How are you feeling?

00:04:12.350 --> 00:04:15.230
Oh, sorry to have made you worry.

00:04:15.230 --> 00:04:16.780
I feel fine!

00:04:16.780 --> 00:04:18.360
Shino, is that your pet?

00:04:18.860 --> 00:04:21.280
Oh, him? He’s Murasame!

00:04:21.690 --> 00:04:24.280
Don’t worry. I haven’t 
let him in the water.

00:04:26.530 --> 00:04:28.330
But dang!

00:04:28.330 --> 00:04:30.370
I’m amazed you slept for a whole week.

00:04:32.000 --> 00:04:34.320
I have these spells every now and then,

00:04:34.320 --> 00:04:36.670
although I’ve never had a 
long one like this before.

00:04:37.040 --> 00:04:38.000
Yeah?

00:04:40.340 --> 00:04:43.410
Yay! It’s my first bath in a week!

00:04:43.410 --> 00:04:45.260
Scrub nice and hard!

00:04:47.120 --> 00:04:49.260
Shino, you’re a weird 
one, you know that?

00:04:49.990 --> 00:04:51.450
I’m normal!

00:04:51.850 --> 00:04:54.100
That isn’t the least 
bit convincing coming

00:04:54.100 --> 00:04:56.100
from someone with a crow on his head.

00:04:56.100 --> 00:04:56.900
Normal!

00:04:57.730 --> 00:04:58.900
Shut your beak!

00:04:59.860 --> 00:05:04.150
Shino, thank you for finding Akihiko.

00:05:06.650 --> 00:05:12.330
Actually, Shino, to be honest, 
I’m just like Akihiko.

00:05:12.330 --> 00:05:14.910
You’re another kid 
who got spirited away?

00:05:15.690 --> 00:05:16.670
You knew?

00:05:17.280 --> 00:05:22.050
The girls in class told me at 
school while you were asleep.

00:05:22.480 --> 00:05:25.670
They said, “That’s what 
makes Shinobu special!”

00:05:26.590 --> 00:05:27.680
I see.

00:05:28.140 --> 00:05:31.450
Personally, I don’t get how 
that makes you so special.

00:05:31.450 --> 00:05:34.060
You managed to come back alive.

00:05:34.350 --> 00:05:35.680
And it happened ages ago, right?

00:05:35.930 --> 00:05:37.520
Yeah. So you see...

00:05:38.410 --> 00:05:41.690
I am actually 22 years old!

00:05:42.260 --> 00:05:43.280
What?!

00:05:47.080 --> 00:05:50.250
When I disappeared in the 
mountains, I was six years old.

00:05:50.250 --> 00:05:52.580
It was a good ten years later

00:05:52.580 --> 00:05:55.700
when Grandma asked Father 
Chudai to find me.

00:05:55.980 --> 00:05:57.480
Dark Sense of Victory

00:05:56.610 --> 00:05:59.070
He looks like that at 22!

00:05:57.480 --> 00:05:58.970
Dark Sense of Victory / Isn’t Listening

00:05:58.970 --> 00:05:59.910
Dark Sense of Victory / Isn’t 
Listening / Nice Follow-up!

00:05:59.070 --> 00:06:01.710
I feel like I just beat him big time!

00:05:59.910 --> 00:06:01.700
Dark Sense of Victory / Isn’t Listening / Nice Follow-up!
 Shino’s Actually 18 Years Old

00:06:02.000 --> 00:06:05.260
They said that I still looked 
like I was six when he found me.

00:06:05.670 --> 00:06:09.050
But I don’t remember what 
happened while I was gone.

00:06:12.800 --> 00:06:14.850
Not that it bothers me any.

00:06:15.420 --> 00:06:18.850
I’ve been developing like 
normal since I’ve been back.

00:06:19.140 --> 00:06:21.860
Damn it! Just give him 10 years...

00:06:22.150 --> 00:06:23.590
Don’t you worry!

00:06:23.590 --> 00:06:25.850
Shino, eventually your 
growth spurt will...

00:06:39.460 --> 00:06:41.450
An anti-Tengu barrier...

00:06:42.210 --> 00:06:45.050
Someone got carried away, 
placing them over the place.

00:07:02.400 --> 00:07:03.150
What?

00:07:03.150 --> 00:07:04.570
It was on Shinobu?

00:07:04.860 --> 00:07:08.470
Yeah! He has a birthmark just like ours!

00:07:09.110 --> 00:07:11.650
Everyone else with a gem has one, too.

00:07:11.650 --> 00:07:14.030
I’m telling you, there is no 
way that’s just a coincidence!

00:07:14.030 --> 00:07:15.080
So does he have a gem?

00:07:17.450 --> 00:07:18.750
Huh? A ball?

00:07:18.750 --> 00:07:20.910
You’re so silly! Of 
course I have balls!

00:07:20.910 --> 00:07:22.330
I am a boy and all.

00:07:25.170 --> 00:07:28.050
I’ll try askin’ him again...

00:07:28.770 --> 00:07:30.760
Damn that brat!

00:07:30.760 --> 00:07:32.480
Does he realize how many he’s-

00:07:32.480 --> 00:07:35.640
Hey, geezer! What’re 
you doin’ out here?

00:07:35.900 --> 00:07:37.350
I knew this was your doing!

00:07:37.920 --> 00:07:39.930
Huh? What is?

00:07:39.930 --> 00:07:43.350
Each time you pass by, you destroy 
the barrier I’ve placed!

00:07:43.720 --> 00:07:45.230
Not my fault.

00:07:45.230 --> 00:07:47.860
If you’re gonna complain, you 
should make somethin’ stronger.

00:07:48.360 --> 00:07:52.450
Wha-?! I already gave Shinobu 
a stronger talisman!

00:07:53.790 --> 00:07:54.870
Hey, geezer.

00:07:56.170 --> 00:08:00.750
Do children who have come back 
ever get whisked away again?

00:08:01.500 --> 00:08:02.370
They do.

00:08:03.320 --> 00:08:06.880
It’s said that Tengu have resided 
in that mountain since ancient times.

00:08:08.300 --> 00:08:10.880
Shinobu spent too much 
time on the other side.

00:08:11.250 --> 00:08:13.930
To make matters worse, 
he was a pitiful child.

00:08:14.340 --> 00:08:16.790
They have a soft spot 
for children like that.

00:08:17.240 --> 00:08:18.850
How was he pitiful?

00:08:19.440 --> 00:08:22.020
He doesn’t know who his father is.

00:08:22.020 --> 00:08:25.400
Not knowing who fathered her child,

00:08:25.400 --> 00:08:27.560
Shinobu’s mother kept 
him locked away to hide

00:08:27.560 --> 00:08:29.150
his existence from the villagers.

00:08:30.470 --> 00:08:32.770
We’re talking a good 
16 years ago here.

00:08:33.280 --> 00:08:36.960
We found his mother after she fell 
from a cliff down to her death.

00:08:36.960 --> 00:08:40.160
But that is when Shinobu went missing.

00:08:42.200 --> 00:08:45.400
Ten years later, I came to this land.

00:08:46.330 --> 00:08:48.920
After I found him, I 
brought Shinobu back...

00:08:49.400 --> 00:08:52.280
...and sealed his memories 
of life on the other side.

00:08:53.720 --> 00:08:55.580
But in a manner of 
speaking, that was the

00:08:55.580 --> 00:08:57.130
“father” who raised Shinobu.

00:08:57.130 --> 00:09:00.320
Isn’t it only natural 
for a parent to eventually

00:09:00.320 --> 00:09:01.770
come for their child?

00:09:06.070 --> 00:09:08.020
Hazuki, did you hear that?

00:09:08.020 --> 00:09:10.460
They finally managed to find him.

00:09:10.460 --> 00:09:14.070
Yeah. It’s been six years-No, seven.

00:09:14.610 --> 00:09:18.850
He was so close and yet it 
took so long to find him.

00:09:19.490 --> 00:09:23.000
Shinobu, don’t even you 
find yourself growing

00:09:23.000 --> 00:09:25.680
weary of the carefree human world?

00:09:30.350 --> 00:09:31.840
Mom...

00:09:32.410 --> 00:09:33.710
Where are we going?

00:09:34.170 --> 00:09:34.970
Shut up!

00:09:35.610 --> 00:09:37.720
I’m giving you up for adoption.

00:09:38.970 --> 00:09:42.180
I don’t want to go... Mom!

00:09:42.490 --> 00:09:45.070
Shut up! You’re coming with me!

00:09:54.860 --> 00:09:57.450
Mom...

00:09:58.200 --> 00:10:01.580
It hurts... It hurts, Mom!

00:10:02.240 --> 00:10:06.710
Hey, Mom...

00:10:17.390 --> 00:10:18.410
Who...?

00:10:21.810 --> 00:10:23.350
You are safe now.

00:10:24.390 --> 00:10:26.410
There is no need to worry,

00:10:26.900 --> 00:10:30.760
for you are no longer a child of man.

00:10:35.030 --> 00:10:37.630
That is... me.

00:10:45.280 --> 00:10:46.380
It couldn’t be...!

00:10:47.080 --> 00:10:48.070
Shinobu!

00:10:55.220 --> 00:10:56.130
Shinobu!

00:10:59.390 --> 00:11:00.760
I warned you.

00:11:01.800 --> 00:11:04.470
I said that I would most assuredly 
come back for him one day.

00:11:14.980 --> 00:11:16.320
That is a human child!

00:11:16.320 --> 00:11:17.280
Give Shinobu back!

00:11:17.610 --> 00:11:18.800
A “human child”?

00:11:18.800 --> 00:11:20.910
You humans have already 
abandoned this child once.

00:11:20.910 --> 00:11:22.530
This child is now ours.

00:11:23.220 --> 00:11:26.290
It is a parent’s duty to retrieve 
a child that has been taken from him!

00:11:31.250 --> 00:11:32.920
Granny! Granny Tae!

00:11:32.920 --> 00:11:34.580
Where is my staff?!

00:11:33.750 --> 00:11:34.290
So!

00:11:34.510 --> 00:11:36.470
I should be able to track their scent.

00:11:35.330 --> 00:11:37.800
Curse that Tengu! This time 
I’ll be sure to slay him!

00:11:44.460 --> 00:11:48.740
Kagetsu, you jerk! I can’t believe 
you randomly picked up some brat!

00:11:48.740 --> 00:11:50.620
What the heck were you thinking?

00:11:50.620 --> 00:11:52.560
This isn’t a cat or a dog!

00:11:53.100 --> 00:11:56.090
Hazuki, you should watch your tongue.

00:11:56.090 --> 00:11:57.570
That is my son.

00:11:57.570 --> 00:11:58.510
Huh?

00:11:59.280 --> 00:12:00.990
Come here, Shinobu.

00:12:01.490 --> 00:12:02.820
Hey, knock it off!

00:12:03.110 --> 00:12:04.250
Kagetsu!

00:12:05.330 --> 00:12:07.330
There, there. Now be a good boy.

00:12:07.660 --> 00:12:11.910
Bro, look, before you 
know it, that human kid-

00:12:11.910 --> 00:12:14.710
I have already bequeathed half 
of myself unto this child.

00:12:15.010 --> 00:12:18.210
As such, this child 
is no longer a human.

00:12:18.590 --> 00:12:20.710
What?! By “half” did you...?

00:12:21.090 --> 00:12:25.250
Please, Hazuki! Help 
me protect this child.

00:12:25.800 --> 00:12:28.720
I do not want to see this 
child be alone any longer.

00:12:29.690 --> 00:12:33.890
Shinobu, you may remain 
small and weak forever.

00:12:34.990 --> 00:12:38.480
Children may be loved by 
virtue of being children.

00:12:39.070 --> 00:12:41.780
Stay this way forever, never changing...

00:12:42.090 --> 00:12:43.250
Kagetsu!

00:12:43.740 --> 00:12:44.920
Kagetsu!

00:12:45.990 --> 00:12:47.150
Kagetsu!

00:12:51.350 --> 00:12:52.480
Hazuki...

00:12:53.480 --> 00:12:54.460
Where is Kagetsu?

00:12:55.160 --> 00:12:56.550
You should already know.

00:12:58.810 --> 00:13:00.460
He is dead!

00:13:06.070 --> 00:13:09.850
Hey, haven’t we just been walkin’ 
in circles for a while now?

00:13:10.310 --> 00:13:11.570
It looks like the territory beyond

00:13:11.570 --> 00:13:13.600
this point falls under the 
mountain deity’s domain.

00:13:13.930 --> 00:13:15.980
This is such a pain!

00:13:15.980 --> 00:13:18.830
Murasame, can you break this barrier?

00:13:18.830 --> 00:13:20.800
Sure can!

00:13:20.800 --> 00:13:22.580
Long time no see, Shino.

00:13:23.340 --> 00:13:24.510
Same for you, Sosuke.

00:13:24.510 --> 00:13:25.860
I’ve been wanting to see you.

00:13:27.670 --> 00:13:28.990
Ao!

00:13:28.990 --> 00:13:30.830
What are you doing here?!

00:13:30.830 --> 00:13:32.490
Are you hunting spirits again?

00:13:32.790 --> 00:13:34.810
Oh, you mean that Tengu?

00:13:34.810 --> 00:13:38.040
I’ll admit I’m interested in him, 
but I’m afraid you guessed wrong.

00:13:38.040 --> 00:13:39.750
Then stay out of our way!

00:13:40.090 --> 00:13:42.880
I have no qualms with 
that, but you know,

00:13:42.880 --> 00:13:46.760
that child might be happier if 
he stayed on the other side.

00:13:48.230 --> 00:13:50.760
While I’m here, let me 
share some juicy news.

00:13:51.260 --> 00:13:53.270
The princess will awaken soon.

00:13:53.710 --> 00:13:57.520
You will never gather 
all eight of your gems.

00:13:57.850 --> 00:13:58.850
What?

00:14:03.690 --> 00:14:05.990
Hey, wait! Give that gem back!

00:14:07.670 --> 00:14:08.610
The geezer!

00:14:18.620 --> 00:14:21.420
Kagetsu is... dead.

00:14:23.210 --> 00:14:24.290
Shinobu!

00:14:26.380 --> 00:14:28.840
You have nothing to fear now.

00:14:30.010 --> 00:14:31.720
You will never starve.

00:14:31.720 --> 00:14:33.890
There is no need for 
you to shed your blood.

00:14:34.850 --> 00:14:36.810
There is nothing to be afraid of.

00:14:37.850 --> 00:14:41.150
I will never make you taste 
solitude ever again...

00:14:45.530 --> 00:14:48.260
I remember... everything.

00:14:49.360 --> 00:14:52.280
I died once... on that fateful day.

00:14:52.850 --> 00:14:55.160
The only reason I’m even here now

00:14:55.160 --> 00:14:57.870
is because Kagetsu gave 
half of his life to me...

00:14:58.750 --> 00:15:02.170
Because he raised me on this side 
with such loving and tender care.

00:15:03.500 --> 00:15:04.750
And yet...

00:15:05.830 --> 00:15:08.350
Kagetsu died all because of me.

00:15:10.130 --> 00:15:11.680
It wasn’t your fault.

00:15:12.390 --> 00:15:14.010
But I...!

00:15:15.140 --> 00:15:18.530
Ten years had passed since Kagetsu 
gave half of his life to you.

00:15:19.060 --> 00:15:21.940
He died because he used up 
all of his powers as a Tengu.

00:15:22.730 --> 00:15:25.320
That was what Kagetsu wanted.

00:15:25.730 --> 00:15:28.470
Even if he did, I don’t!

00:15:36.950 --> 00:15:40.960
Kakiya Inn

00:15:37.250 --> 00:15:40.960
Geezer, I’m amazed you survived 
fallin’ off that cliff!

00:15:41.290 --> 00:15:44.920
I know! To think that you 
of all people saved me.

00:15:44.920 --> 00:15:46.560
I’ll never live it down!

00:15:47.210 --> 00:15:48.460
You owe me one!

00:15:48.460 --> 00:15:50.970
Shut up! Ow, ow, ow...

00:15:51.720 --> 00:15:56.350
Father Chudai, it’s my fault that 
you were so gravely injured...

00:15:56.810 --> 00:15:59.220
I am truly sorry.

00:15:59.700 --> 00:16:01.890
It isn’t your fault, Granny Tae!

00:16:01.890 --> 00:16:03.730
Curse that Tengu!

00:16:03.730 --> 00:16:07.230
As soon as my wounds have healed, 
I will get Shinobu back!

00:16:07.470 --> 00:16:11.540
To be honest, I have already 
half given up my Shinobu...

00:16:11.540 --> 00:16:13.240
I had prepared myself for this.

00:16:14.990 --> 00:16:17.030
I always suspected that this 
day would come eventually.

00:16:17.530 --> 00:16:23.120
After all, that boy is “special.”

00:16:23.540 --> 00:16:26.750
Why?! Don’t you love your grandson?

00:16:26.940 --> 00:16:28.120
Of course I do!

00:16:28.120 --> 00:16:30.310
He is my one and only grandchild!

00:16:30.310 --> 00:16:33.090
Then why are you so 
quick to give up on him?

00:16:33.830 --> 00:16:38.760
Once... my daughter sent me a letter.

00:16:39.100 --> 00:16:42.310
It said, “I am carrying 
a Tengu’s child.”

00:16:43.100 --> 00:16:46.070
Naturally, I didn’t believe her.

00:16:46.070 --> 00:16:49.780
My daughter did whatever she 
pleased throughout life.

00:16:50.450 --> 00:16:53.950
I assumed she simply couldn’t 
tell me who the father was,

00:16:54.030 --> 00:16:55.780
so I never bothered 
to see my grandchild.

00:16:59.540 --> 00:17:02.290
Mom

00:17:02.560 --> 00:17:06.630
But I was fraught with regret 
after I lost my daughter.

00:17:06.630 --> 00:17:09.290
I asked myself, “Why did 
I abandon those two?”

00:17:09.750 --> 00:17:13.300
In that case, Shinobu has truly Tengu 
blood coursing through his veins!

00:17:28.230 --> 00:17:32.070
Shinobu, it’s been a 
while! Have you been well?

00:17:32.330 --> 00:17:33.390
Natsume...

00:17:33.910 --> 00:17:36.740
I see you have regained 
your memories about us.

00:17:37.360 --> 00:17:41.020
Yeah... About everything, 
including how Kagetsu died.

00:17:41.740 --> 00:17:43.500
He died for someone like me...

00:17:44.120 --> 00:17:45.330
Shinobu...!

00:17:45.660 --> 00:17:49.290
To be precise, Bro 
isn’t fully dead yet.

00:17:53.670 --> 00:17:54.800
Hazuki?

00:17:54.800 --> 00:17:55.940
What do you mean?

00:17:56.630 --> 00:17:59.090
Fortunately, we still have his body.

00:17:59.640 --> 00:18:00.600
Where?!

00:18:03.100 --> 00:18:04.600
That’s not for you to know!

00:18:04.600 --> 00:18:06.730
But I will tell you this much:

00:18:08.560 --> 00:18:10.720
Even if you said you 
wanted to give this back,

00:18:10.720 --> 00:18:12.980
I’m pretty confident Kagetsu 
wouldn’t accept it.

00:18:31.260 --> 00:18:35.730
Hazuki, I have bequeathed half 
of myself unto this child.

00:18:37.860 --> 00:18:39.360
Things seem to be proceeding nicely.

00:18:44.140 --> 00:18:45.480
Of course they are!

00:18:45.480 --> 00:18:47.310
Who do you take me for?

00:18:47.810 --> 00:18:50.400
That aside, I expect you to return 
Kagetsu’s body immediately!

00:18:51.020 --> 00:18:52.190
Why should I?

00:18:52.190 --> 00:18:54.550
I still haven’t received 
my end of the bargain.

00:18:55.030 --> 00:18:56.650
That’s not how things work.

00:18:57.320 --> 00:19:00.450
Doesn’t Shinobu have that gem 
or whatever it is you’re after?

00:19:00.990 --> 00:19:03.410
You’re free to snatch 
it away or steal it!

00:19:05.620 --> 00:19:06.790
Are you sure about that?

00:19:06.790 --> 00:19:07.870
Don’t pester me!

00:19:10.790 --> 00:19:12.750
If you’re going to give 
me that much leeway...

00:19:19.090 --> 00:19:22.920
I bet you must miss Kagetsu 
since he passed away, huh?

00:19:31.770 --> 00:19:33.170
Are you Shinobu?

00:19:33.860 --> 00:19:35.320
Sosuke...?

00:19:35.940 --> 00:19:37.820
No, you aren’t Sosuke, are you?

00:19:39.300 --> 00:19:42.700
You want to see that 
other Tengu, don’t you?

00:19:45.830 --> 00:19:46.990
I do...!

00:19:48.480 --> 00:19:49.580
This way.

00:19:51.120 --> 00:19:53.690
I died on that day.

00:19:54.290 --> 00:19:56.360
Even if you said you 
wanted to give this back,

00:19:56.360 --> 00:19:58.710
I’m pretty confident Kagetsu 
wouldn’t accept it.

00:19:59.420 --> 00:20:03.470
Despite what Hazuki said, I had 
no right to accept that gift.

00:20:04.390 --> 00:20:07.470
But since I was an ignorant child...

00:20:16.590 --> 00:20:17.730
Kagetsu!

00:20:18.530 --> 00:20:20.990
Kagetsu, it’s me! It’s Shinobu!

00:20:26.460 --> 00:20:29.870
That’s useless. He 
is still incomplete.

00:20:31.120 --> 00:20:32.960
In a sense, he is merely a vessel.

00:20:33.540 --> 00:20:37.380
Don’t you possess half of 
him inside of you, Shinobu?

00:20:39.570 --> 00:20:42.130
That’s right. It’s in me...

00:20:42.670 --> 00:20:46.140
Then all you need to do is 
return what was given to you.

00:20:54.300 --> 00:20:55.650
All right.

00:20:57.900 --> 00:20:58.850
Shinobu!

00:21:01.570 --> 00:21:03.150
Stop being so stupid!

00:21:06.970 --> 00:21:10.540
Thank you for bringing me back, Hazuki.

00:21:11.180 --> 00:21:14.080
I am going to return everything 
that should go back to Kagetsu.

00:21:14.330 --> 00:21:15.040
What?!

00:21:15.830 --> 00:21:17.310
This is for the best.

00:21:19.120 --> 00:21:20.460
Don’t do it!

00:21:23.420 --> 00:21:24.550
Hazuki?!

00:21:27.470 --> 00:21:29.560
Could you keep out of this?

00:21:33.020 --> 00:21:33.810
Hazuki!

00:21:50.620 --> 00:21:53.700
Shinobu!

00:23:26.090 --> 00:23:41.100
Twin Moons

00:23:26.790 --> 00:23:29.010
So, like, the first 
time I saw you, Shino,

00:23:29.010 --> 00:23:31.970
I thought a super cute girl just 
transferred into our class.

00:23:31.970 --> 00:23:32.760
That right?

00:23:32.760 --> 00:23:34.810
But then when I heard that 
you’re actually 18,

00:23:34.810 --> 00:23:37.340
I was like, “Dang! He acts 
mighty immature for his age.”

00:23:37.340 --> 00:23:40.730
Jerk! Are you picking a fight with 
a grin plastered on your face?!
